# Files crew makes in the home on each machine, and the test sandboxes.
bin/release/
logs/
.crew*.lock
.crew-lease-lost
projects/*/local.env
lead/.claude/settings.local.json
# MCP servers crew writes from each project's mcp.json, with its secrets, and
# the temporary files it writes them through (mcp.local.json.<random>).
projects/*/mcp.local.json*
lead/.mcp.json*
tests/.tmp/
# What a stray `go build` leaves, at the root or in cmd/crew/; releases are built by
# the workflow.
/crew
/cmd/crew/crew
